stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> disconnected : platform available but not configured

  disconnected --> connecting : OAuth flow / CLI login initiated
  connecting --> connected : token saved to connections store
  connecting --> disconnected : OAuth cancelled or CLI error

  connected --> expired : provider reports token expired
  expired --> connecting : user clicks Reconnect

  connected --> disconnected : DELETE /api/connections/{id} (disconnect)
  expired --> disconnected : DELETE /api/connections/{id}

  connected --> [*]